{
  "title": { "zh": "先横后竖", "en": "Across, then down" },
  "intro": [
    {
      "t": {
        "zh": "三点平均只看一行。九格平均能不能用它拼出来？",
        "en": "The three-point average looks along one line. Can the nine-cell average be built from it?"
      }
    }
  ],
  "after": {
    "zh": "横着平均一次、竖着再平均一次，就是九格平均，乘法从 9 次降到 6 次：这样的核是<wiki-ref to=\"separable\"></wiki-ref>的。",
    "en": "Averaging across once and down once is the nine-cell average, with 6 multiplications instead of 9: such a kernel is <wiki-ref to=\"separable\"></wiki-ref>."
  },
  "tray": "kernel",
  "tasks": [
